| `tests/integration/test_toolchain_gate.py` | Fails a workflow job whose `runs-on` is not a configured pinned image, a setup-node or setup-python step whose version is not the earlier `toolchain` step's output, a configured Python below `layers.backend.python` or `requires-python`, and an `fe-install` recipe that runs npm before the Node check, which it also runs against a stubbed `node`, so every version CI uses has one home in config. | `make test` | [`toolchain.runner_images`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`toolchain.node_major`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`toolchain.python`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Reads the workflow files; it cannot see a version a reusable workflow or an action sets elsewhere. Not the runtime check: `scripts/check_toolchain.py` refuses the wrong Node on a host. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
